@startuml
title set PATH = JSON — Change a value
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
actor "User" as U
participant "TerminalUI" as UI
participant "DebugSession" as S
participant "Scanner / branches" as B
participant "Inspection / instrumentation" as I
participant "Candidate DebugSession" as C
participant "VectorRunner" as R
participant "Vector process" as V
U -> UI : set PATH = JSON
UI -> I : split_assignment()
UI -> S : set_value(PATH, JSON)
S -> I : parse_path(PATH); check current-scope local availability
S -> R : strict_json(JSON) in runner.py
S -> S : Resolve current offset, loop and iteration; append candidate edit
S -> C : _with_edits(): fresh session and caches
C -> B : Build prefix and checkpoint metadata
C -> R : run() / run_checkpoints(original input, edits)
R -> I : Insert replay edits and diagnostic capture
R -> V : vector vrl --program FILE --input FILE
V --> R : Encoded event, locals and position, or diagnostics
R --> C : RunResult or DebugError
C --> S : Candidate state or replay failure
alt Successful replay exposes exact requested JSON value
S -> S : _commit_edits(): replace caches and trace; compute diffs
else Candidate rejected
S --> UI : Command error; original session unchanged
end
opt Command completed without a command error
UI -> S : current_state() and source_expression()
S --> UI : Copied current state and source cursor
UI -> UI : show_state(): enabled sections, diffs, watches and errors
end
UI --> U : Result or command error; return to prompt
@enduml
